  "label": "transphobic stereotype",
  "description": "A harmful and derogatory stereotype that portrays transgender people in a negative or mocking light. The meme's framing of the trans woman in a picture frame, combined with the text 'no to transphobes', may be interpreted as reinforcing a stereotype that trans people are 'boxed in' or 'contained', which is a form of transphobic imagery.",
